      <Steps>
      <Step>
      <strong>Clone it</strong>
      <CodeBlock code={"git clone https://github.com/dogsbay/dogsbay-xml-dita-tutorial.git\ncd dogsbay-xml-dita-tutorial"} lang="bash" />
      <p>The clone opens on <code>main</code>, which contains the separate repair exercise. Use the stage branches for this tutorial.</p>
      </Step>
      <Step>
      <strong>Check out the first stage</strong>
      <CodeBlock code={"git checkout tutorial/00-setup"} lang="bash" />
